.TH DEEPIN-IMAN 1 "August 2026" "deepin-iman 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deepin-iman \- AI-powered man page viewer for deepin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepin-iman
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B deepin-iman
is a man page browser that deeply integrates AI capabilities with the
traditional man page experience. It allows users to browse, search, and
navigate all man pages, and leverages AI to provide multi-language
translation, usage examples, command Q&A, and command parsing.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Full-text search
Search across all man pages using SQLite FTS5 full-text indexing.
Toggle case-sensitive matching and whole-word matching from the search
bar, similar to VSCode find.
.TP
.B Cross-reference navigation
Click SEE ALSO links to jump between related man pages. Navigate
back and forward with Alt+Left / Alt+Right.
.TP
.B AI translation
User-configurable OpenAI-compatible providers. Translation appears
inline beside the original text with synchronized scrolling. Seven
target languages supported (Chinese, English, Japanese, French,
German, Spanish, Russian).
.TP
.B Inline split view
Translation and AI-generated examples are displayed in a split panel
next to the original man page, not in a popup dialog. Scroll one
side and the other follows.
.TP
.B AI examples
AI-generated usage examples with annotations and expected output,
displayed inline beside the original man page.
.TP
.B AI Q&A
Ask questions about the current man page and get context-aware answers
from the AI.
.TP
.B Command parsing
Paste a command line (e.g. \fBsudo netstat \-tlunp\fR) and the app
extracts the command name and jumps to the corresponding man page.
.TP
.B Favorites
Bookmark man pages from the menu. Access the favorites list from the
menu; double-click to jump to a page.
.TP
.B Browse history
Automatically records visited man pages. Keeps the latest 100 entries.
Access from the menu; double-click to jump.
.TP
.B Auto index update
Detects new or removed man pages on startup. Manual refresh available
from the menu.
.TP
.B Configurable AI providers
Add, edit, delete, and test OpenAI-compatible providers. Includes
test-connection validation. Provider settings persist across restarts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/deepin/deepin-iman/
Application data directory (manindex.db, translation.db, favorite.db, history.db).
.TP
.I ~/.config/deepin/deepin-iman.conf
Configuration file (QSettings, AI provider list).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1),
.BR mandoc (1),
.BR groff (1)
